     A** Direct Debit History File
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PDH01                     TEXT('DIRECT DEBIT HISTORY FILE')
     A            DHCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            DHFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            DHFYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A            DHPODT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      TEXT('POSTING DATE')
     A            DHBAT#         9P 0       COLHDG('BATCH #')
     A                                      TEXT('WCMS BATCH#')
     A            DHTMDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      TEXT('TRANSMISSION DATE')
     A            DHSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            DHUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            DHPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            DHTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            DHDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
